refused: d100_mixing_units.cy:13:44, line 13 column 44
13 |     let $b: i32[unit: time.seconds] set_to $a + 5 storage.bytes;
   |                                            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 what: this mixes `i32[unit: time.seconds]` and `i32[unit: storage.bytes]`
 why:  the same units can add and compare, and mixing them is refused (D100)
